      "v0.4.21 fixes frozen airborne Pidgeotto Stadium models by selecting a moving authored alternate standby clip for ambient sky traffic and Fly Your Pokemon flight while leaving other flyers unchanged",
      "v0.4.20 removes the extra translucent MOD SETTINGS icon wells and enlarges category artwork while keeping the full-cell selection highlight and all twelve bundled PNG icons",
