      "v0.4.17 adds AUTO/RECOMMENDED adaptive graphics and a broad performance pass: tighter off-screen culling and mesh budgets, medium/high preset cost reductions, 20-60Hz performance-tier Wilds/ambient updates, zero ambient-flyer work in native 2D, and Weather AUTO starting at medium",
      "v0.4.16 makes native Gold/Silver 2D a first-class overworld mode: voxel3d is the sole renderer master switch, 3D camera/input state is released on OFF, companion drawWorld pipelines are bypassed only for the native redraw and restored, Weather FX/zoom/wild presentation fall back cleanly, and Kanto refuses rather than forcing 3D",
      "v0.4.15 docks the MOD SETTINGS root to a compact right-side homescreen-style 4x4 app grid so the paused game stays visible on the left while all categories remain on one screen",
      "v0.4.14 fits all 13 MOD SETTINGS root tiles on one compact 4-column x 4-row modern grid with no category paging and tighter gutters",
