      "v0.4.09 makes iOS native orientation authoritative by explicitly requesting Portrait + both landscape directions with SDL/engine fallback, removes automatic iOS post-frame flipping, and makes OPEN WORLD residency independent from the 3D VOXEL WORLD master switch",
      "v0.4.08 redesigns this mod's MOD SETTINGS root as a 2x3 paged icon grid with spatial keyboard/controller/mobile navigation while retaining ManagerState-native category option rows, persistence, live CUSTOM UI rebuilding, OTHER fallback and reset behavior",
