      "v0.4.06 stabilizes the 2D player billboard in THIRD PERSON: player-only presentation scale tracks the live camera boom, high-resolution player sheets normalize to the native trainer footprint, and solid/ghost/shadow copies share the same transform without changing NPC/world perspective",
