      "v0.3.91 restores Safari/Fuchsia HM progression: GOLD TEETH stay Kanto-local, the Warden consumes them and gives retry-safe Gold STRENGTH, the Secret House gives retry-safe Gold SURF, and Yellow field-HM badge checks use Kanto badges instead of Johto badges",
      "v0.3.90 restores Yellow Rival progression at Cerulean bridge, Pokemon Tower 2F and late Route 22, keeps those script-revealed actors hidden until their trigger, and makes the Kanto Hall of Fame remove the Cerulean Cave guard/unlock Mewtwo access",
