      "v0.3.86 fixes static encounter parity: Power Plant Voltorb/Electrode stay disguised as Poke Balls until touched, Yellow reveal text runs before Gold wild battles, blackout restores one-off actors, and completed static encounters cannot leak back through raw-map fallback; v0.3.85 dungeon puzzles remain intact",
      "v0.3.84 restores the connected Rocket Hideout → Pokemon Tower → Mr. Fuji → Poke Flute → Snorlax quest chain in Gold: Yellow-only LIFT KEY/SILPH SCOPE/POKE FLUTE remain Kanto-local, the Rocket elevator works, Marowak is an uncatchable scripted level-30 Gold battle, and both sleeping Snorlax become normal level-30 Gold wild battles",
      "v0.3.83 adds generation-safe Kanto item/fossil progression: Yellow-only/conflicting CARD KEY/SECRET KEY/fossils remain Kanto-local, Gen-1 machines translate by taught move, Mt. Moon fossils revive at Cinnabar Lab as level-30 Gold-owned Pokemon, and Cinnabar Gym uses the Kanto SECRET KEY",
      "v0.3.80 fixes the giant green meshes over Kanto water at the geometry source: private Yellow Surf cells cannot be promoted into projected tree/wall/prop solids, Kanto water-facing map edges extend as flat water instead of the global Gen-1 tree-wall apron, and the persistent terrain cache is revision-bumped so stale bad meshes cannot reload",
      "v0.3.78 fixes the screenshot-confirmed color-layer bug: the Kanto player now reuses Gold's live native SpriteRenderer/PAL_OW_RED instead of a Yellow RED card recolored like terrain, and Kanto world atlases no longer inject Johto shade-population dithering; native Kanto/Gen-2-Kanto shade positions map directly through the locked Johto material ramp, removing checkerboard paths and noisy walls while keeping coherent Cherrygrove/Route 29 color families",
      "v0.3.77 fixes the remaining some-good/some-bad Kanto color drift by locking each outdoor material category to one map-frequency-weighted Johto family; Cherrygrove drives town/city materials, Route 29 drives route materials, missing families are supplemented across those scenes, and uncommon Kanto tiles are categorized before fallback so per-tile alternate slots can no longer break visual consistency",
      "v0.3.76 fixes the remaining yellow-heavy Kanto color balance: scene-matched Johto PalMap slots now transfer the donor tile's exact 64-pixel 2bpp shade population using deterministic Bayer tie-breaking, so one large pale Kanto shade can split across Johto's real light/mid/dark proportions while Kanto/native-Kanto pixel positions stay intact",
      "v0.3.75 fixes the screenshot-confirmed v0.3.74 over-projection: Johto donor pixel layouts are no longer pasted onto Kanto. Kanto/native-Kanto texture positions stay intact while exact scene-used Johto PalMap slots and quantile-matched light/mid/dark shade balance drive the visible color/contrast",
      "v0.3.74 removes the remaining yellow/olive Kanto cast by borrowing the actual scene-used Johto material tile, not only its palette family: exact per-tile PalMap slots now beat broad role fallbacks, and Johto 2bpp shade patterns are sampled for Kanto surfaces while Kanto geometry/collision stays authoritative",
      "v0.3.73 fixes the screenshot-visible Kanto/Johto color gap: Kanto/native Gen-2 geometry remains intact, while towns/cities use Cherrygrove and routes use Route 29 as scene-aware color donors; roof/facade roles use PalMap slots from tiles actually present in that Johto map",
      "v0.3.70 restores Yellow's three Kanto starter gifts as real Gold-owned transactions: Melanie's Bulbasaur requires Pikachu happiness 147+, Damian gives Charmander, Officer Jenny requires the Kanto Thunder Badge for Squirtle, and all three use level 10, Gen-2 gift happiness 120, player OT/Pokedex/storage atomicity and one-time Kanto-local completion",
      "v0.3.69 restores the story-free Kanto Bike Voucher chain: Vermilion Fan Club gives one voucher with exact yes/no and Gold key-item-capacity behavior (Kanto-local when Gen-2 has no voucher item), Cerulean Bike Shop atomically exchanges it for Gold's real BICYCLE, preserves the impossible retail pitch, and migrates compatible ownership",
      "v0.3.68 restores story-free Kanto civic parity: all four Saffron guards consume the correct Gold drink and enforce exact gate pushback cells, while Pewter Museum charges Gold money and awards/hides OLD AMBER with persistent physical state",
