      "v0.3.66 removes more steady Kanto render CPU/GC work without lowering quality: neighbor urgency/prefetch is change-driven with cached second-ring direction vectors, the Kanto player proxy/card is identity-cached, and custom-player ownership leaves pcall after one successful identity probe",
