      "v0.3.62 removes more Kanto completed-step overhead without lowering quality: ordinary non-warp cells skip warp resolution/tile work, warp bounce state uses scalars instead of string keys, classic encounter settings are cached between menu changes, and Surf passability reads one collision tile",
