      "v0.3.56 isolates Kanto THIRD PERSON Character Selector special-card and retained body-yaw state from hidden Johto: Kanto Bicycle/Surf correctly use authored cards, hidden Johto mount/fishing state cannot suppress the Kanto model, and Kanto travel-facing persists independently across render passes",
      "v0.3.55 fixes Kanto THIRD PERSON Character Selector player-model animation by refreshing the selector voxel skeletal frame from the visible Kanto proxy before shadow/main draw, including render-only walk-run magnitude and ledge-jump state while leaving Johto gameplay ownership untouched",
